# API rules

## References

- [`docs/API_INVENTORY.md`](docs/API_INVENTORY.md) — existing endpoints
- [`docs/API_TESTING_GUIDE.md`](docs/API_TESTING_GUIDE.md) — setup and standalone API testing
- [`docs/openapi.yaml`](docs/openapi.yaml) — OpenAPI / API reference

## Rules

- Inspect existing APIs before creating a new API.
- Reuse existing APIs when appropriate.
- Do not create duplicate endpoints.
- Add a new API only when the approved functionality genuinely requires it.
- Preserve existing authentication.
- Preserve existing authorization.
- Validate important business rules server-side.
- Keep API changes backward-compatible where possible.
- Document meaningful new API behavior after approved API changes.

Do not invent endpoints or request/response fields that are not in the inventory, OpenAPI, or code.
